Class attribute vs instance attribute distinction: modifying
Child.class_var should not affect Base.class_var. Our model copies
the class struct, so modifications to the child's copy don't
propagate correctly. Also: __class__ attribute, type() builtin,
property decorators. Affects ~33 ESBMC tests.
